WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
DataGvat MCP Quick Start Guide

00:03.000 --> 00:20.000
Installation Step 1: Install globally with npm install -g @datagvat/mcp-server

00:20.000 --> 00:40.000
Installation Step 2: Verify installation with datagvat --version

00:40.000 --> 01:00.000
Installation Step 3: Configure Claude Desktop by editing claude_desktop_config.json

01:00.000 --> 01:30.000
Configuration: Add mcpServers section with datagvat command and optional environment variables

01:30.000 --> 01:50.000
Your First Query: Ask Claude to find Vienna datasets about public transport

01:50.000 --> 02:20.000
Claude uses MCP tools: search_datasets, get_dataset, and finds 12 relevant datasets

02:20.000 --> 02:30.000
You're ready! Explore the full documentation at datagvat.dev
